    "specialists_are_invisible_to_our_book": true,
    "evidence": "4530 distinct wallets trade weather; our followed set holds only 75, ALL rank\u2264250 (ZERO beyond). Every disjoint-week-HELD specialist is beyond-250/unfollowed. Global leaderboard rank IS the wrong filter for a niche \u2014 CONFIRMED.",
